example : levelDistRead wH wG 1 2 1 1 11 1 13 1 12 1 1 1
    spA spB spC spD := by decide +kernel

/-! The two ends refuse, the stated level the one datum moved:
`[10 : 1]` sits below the second jump's lower bracket, and
